{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05434","headline":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边 · 王丘","name":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德业蕴时宗，幽符梦象通。\n台司计祈父，师律总元戎。\n出入敷能政，谋猷体至公。\n赠行光睿什，宴别感宸衷。\n文炳高天曜，恩垂湛露融。\n建牙之塞表，鸣鼓接云中。\n策密鬼神秘，威成剑骑雄。\n朔门正炎月，兵气已秋风。\n肃杀从此始，方知胡运穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王丘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}